{%- comment -%}
  The Shop journey: three hardcoded panels.

  Everything else in this drawer is drawn from the store's navigation. This part
  is not, and deliberately so — putting these levels into `bb-v4-header` would
  put them into the desktop header too, which is not where they belong. So they
  live here, in the one place a phone reads.

  The consequence is that this file IS the menu for these three panels. To change
  a row, change the line for it; each is `Label|tab-handle`, and a tile carries
  the name of its picture in `assets/` as a third field. Nothing here is written
  down anywhere else in the theme.

  A tab handle is the collection a tab on the all-collections rail stands for —
  the rail's own blocks are where those come from, so a row added here wants a
  tab there to match.

  The pictures are addressed by hand rather than read from the collections,
  because no collection in this store has an image set — `collection.image`
  would give nine grey squares. They live in Shopify Files, not in the theme, so
  they are served from the CDN and cost the theme nothing; they are cropped to
  the framing the design draws, at three times the drawn size so they hold up on
  a phone screen.

  Those addresses carry a `?v=` stamp, so changing a picture means uploading the
  new one to Files and putting its address on the line — replacing the file in
  the admin will not reach back into this list.

  Takes `arrow` (the row chevron) and `title` from the caller, so the head of the
  first panel says whatever the menu item that opened it says.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture category_rows -%}
  Cleanser|cleanser;
  Toner|toners;
  Moisturiser|moisturiser;
  Sun Protection|sun-protection;
  Lip Care|lip-care;
  Serums|serums
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture concern_rows -%}
  Acne & Blemishes|acne-blemishes|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-acne-blemishes.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Age Spots & Pigmentation|age-spots-pigmentation|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-age-spots-pigmentation.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Clogged Pores & Blackheads|clogged-pores-blackheads|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-clogged-pores-blackheads.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Oil Control|oil-control|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-oil-control.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Sun Damage|sun-damage-1|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-sun-damage.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Uneven Skin Tone|uneven-skin-tone|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-uneven-skin-tone.jpg?v=1788349027;
  Dryness & Dullness|dryness-dullness|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-dryness-dullness.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Oxidative Stress & Cellular Repair|oxidative-stress-cellular-repair|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-oxidative-stress.jpg?v=1788349028;
  Redness and Irritation|redness-and-irritation|https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0715/1157/2666/files/hmd-concern-redness-irritation.jpg?v=1788349028
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Records split on ";" and fields on "|", so the lists above stay one row to a
    line and a label is free to contain a comma.
  endcomment
  assign categories = category_rows | split: ';'
  assign concerns = concern_rows | split: ';'

  comment
    Every row here goes to one page — the `all-collections` view, which is the
    one with the category and concern rail on it — and names the tab it wants
    with `c`. That is the parameter the rail itself reads on load, so arriving
    from the menu and tapping the tab once there land on the same state.

    Landing on a handle the rail has no tab for falls back to the first tab
    rather than erroring, so a row can never take a visitor nowhere.
  endcomment
  assign acl_base = routes.all_products_collection_url | append: '?view=all-collections'
  assign all_url = acl_base
  assign sets_url = acl_base | append: '&c=combos'
-%}

{%- comment -%} ------------------------------------------------------- Shop {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="hmd__panel" data-hmd-panel="shop" hidden>
  {%- render 'header-menu-drawer-head', title: title, back: 'root' -%}

  <ul class="hmd__list" role="list">
    <li class="hmd__item">
      <a class="hmd__row" href="{{ all_url }}">
        <span class="hmd__label">All products</span>
        {{ arrow }}
      </a>
    </li>
    <li class="hmd__item">
      <button class="hmd__row" type="button" data-hmd-goto="shop-category">
        <span class="hmd__label">By category</span>
        {{ arrow }}
      </button>
    </li>
    <li class="hmd__item">
      <button class="hmd__row" type="button" data-hmd-goto="shop-concern">
        <span class="hmd__label">Shop by concern</span>
        {{ arrow }}
      </button>
    </li>
    <li class="hmd__item">
      <a class="hmd__row" href="{{ sets_url }}">
        <span class="hmd__label">Sets and offers</span>
        {{ arrow }}
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

{%- comment -%} -------------------------------------------- Shop / By category {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="hmd__panel" data-hmd-panel="shop-category" hidden>
  {%- render 'header-menu-drawer-head', title: 'By category', back: 'shop' -%}

  <ul class="hmd__list" role="list">
    {%- for row in categories -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign parts = row | strip | split: '|'
        assign label = parts[0] | strip
        assign handle = parts[1] | strip
        assign href = acl_base | append: '&c=' | append: handle
      -%}
      {%- if label != blank -%}
        <li class="hmd__item">
          <a class="hmd__row" href="{{ href }}">
            <span class="hmd__label">{{ label }}</span>
            {{ arrow }}
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ----------------------------------------- Shop / Shop by concern {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="hmd__panel" data-hmd-panel="shop-concern" hidden>
  {%- render 'header-menu-drawer-head', title: 'Shop by concern', back: 'shop' -%}

  <ul class="hmd__grid" role="list">
    {%- for row in concerns -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign parts = row | strip | split: '|'
        assign label = parts[0] | strip
        assign handle = parts[1] | strip
        assign pic = parts[2] | strip
        assign href = acl_base | append: '&c=' | append: handle
      -%}
      {%- if label != blank -%}
        <li class="hmd__tile">
          <a class="hmd__tilelink" href="{{ href }}">
            <span class="hmd__tilemedia">
              <img
                src="{{ pic }}"
                srcset="{{ pic }}&width=220 220w, {{ pic }} 330w"
                sizes="110px"
                width="330"
                height="330"
                alt=""
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
            </span>
            <span class="hmd__tilelabel">{{ label }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</section>
